-# Overrides app/views/order_mailer/_transportation_instructions.html.haml.
-# Theater Wit's directions, kept verbatim: which "L" lines stop where, which
-# bus, and the lot behind Kubo. The generic version can only print an address.
-# The address itself is a fact, so it is read rather than repeated here.
%h5 Getting Here
%p
  #{theater_info.name} is located at #{theater_info.street_address}, between Southport and Racine.  We are accessible by "L" at the Belmont stop for the red, brown and purple lines four blocks east of us.  The 77 CTA bus also drops you on our doorstep.  If you will be driving, there is often street parking, and we offer self parking in our large lot behind Kubo restaurant, directly across the street for $10.
